 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-id1422276\" class=\"interactive ost-assessed-feature\" data-label=\"Link to Learning\">\n<h2 class=\"os-title\" data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"os-note-body\">\n<p id=\"fs-id2258341\">See an interactive animation of the ATP-producing glycolysis process at this <a href=\"https://openstax.org/l/glycolysis_stgs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">site</a>.</p>\n<div data-type=\"injected-exercise\" class=\"os-embed autogenerated-content\" data-injected-from-nickname=\"\" data-injected-from-version=\"14\" data-injected-from-url=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/api/exercises?q=tag:apbio-ch06-ex049\" data-tags=\"apbio-ch06 apbio-ch06-s04 apbio-ch06-s04-lo01 apbio-ch06-ex049 exid:apbio-ch06-ex049 context-cnxmod:0c2a7c48-3b37-42de-96f5-df9876da7033 context-cnxmod:99b98703-3f88-4b35-88f9-9f53c7cc614d interactive aplo:stax-apbio:ENE-1.I aplo:stax-apbio:ENE-1.J dok:2 aplo:stax-apbio:ENE-1.K aplo:stax-apbio:ENE-1.L filter-type:import:has-context assignment-type:homework blooms:2 book:stax-bio apbio book:stax-apbio filter-type:import:hs inbook-yes book-slug:biology-ap-courses module-slug:biology-2e:6-5-enzymes module-slug:biology-ap-courses:6-5-enzymes time:medium book-slug:biology-2e\" data-is-vocab=\"false\" data-question-count=\"1\" data-is-multipart=\"False\">\n    <div data-type=\"exercise-question\" data-is-answer-order-important=\"true\" data-formats=\"free-response multiple-choice\" id=\"503123\"><div class=\"os-problem-container\">\n        <div data-type=\"question-stem\">Explain why the lock-and-key model does not adequately represent the relationship between hexokinase and glucose.</div>\n        <ol data-type=\"question-answers\" type=\"a\">\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">Hexokinase changes conformation in presence of glucose</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">Hexokinase induces change in the glucose structure</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">Hexokinase requires an effector molecule to bind at allosteric site</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            <li data-type=\"question-answer\" data-correctness=\"\">\n                <div data-type=\"answer-content\">Hexokinase binds glucose without any conformational change</div>\n                \n            </li>\n            </ol>\n        </div></div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>",
